            <span>What is the average house construction cost per square foot in Ahmedabad?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-icon-arrow"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-pane" style="display: block;">
            In Ahmedabad, standard residential construction typically ranges between ₹1,650 to ₹1,950 per sq. ft. For premium and luxury villas with bespoke elevations and branded fittings, rates range from ₹2,100 to ₹2,800+ per sq. ft. Kanha Construction offers transparent, fixed-cost contracts with no unexpected escalations.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>What is included in Kanha Construction's turnkey project contract?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-icon-arrow"></i>
          </button>
