            Our turnkey service covers full end-to-end management: architectural 3D elevations, municipal sanction floor plans, RCC foundation & structure, masonry, plumbing, electrical wiring, flooring, interior modular woodworking, and final move-in key handover.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Do you provide 3D elevation designs and municipal sanction drawings?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-icon-arrow"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-pane">
            Yes, our in-house architectural department creates photorealistic 3D elevations, spatial floor layouts, and compliant structural engineering drawings aligned with Ahmedabad municipal safety codes.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-card">
          <button class="faq-question-btn">
            <span>Which areas of Ahmedabad do you serve?</span>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down faq-icon-arrow"></i>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer-pane">
            We actively execute projects in Nikol, Naroda, Vastral, Odhav, Bopal, South Bopal, SG Highway, Science City, Vatva GIDC, Kuha, Chiloda, and Gandhinagar.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-card">
